   :why "Preview rejects a runtime-provided canonical ID that differs from the requested prefix. That loses access to an otherwise valid session and its callbacks."
   :detail "Separate strict caller-supplied create ID checking from resume rekeying, routing early callbacks, and replacement/rollback ownership. Preview refuses a second open handle to the same ID."}
