   :detail "listModels caches the first success for the connection, serializes concurrent misses, normalizes missing runtime capability limits, and permits a local model-list callback. setModel uses modelId, reasoningEffort, reasoningSummary, contextTier, modelCapabilities. The live autoTier/fusionTier variants are explicitly experimental; startup capi.autoTier is a provider-advertised string, not a closed enum."}
